{
  "format": "mavescape-design",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "E. coli DHFR, growth without and with the Lon protease",
  "description": "Every substitution of E. coli dihydrofolate reductase (DHFR, 159 residues) on a plasmid complementing a strain without its own DHFR and thymidylate synthase (ER2566 ΔfolA ΔthyA), grown in a turbidostat and sampled at 0, 2, 4, 6, 8, 12, 16 and 18 hours. Selected in the parental strain, which lacks the Lon protease as all B strains do (−Lon), and again with Lon reintroduced on the chromosome (+Lon). Four sub-libraries of 40 positions (SL1–SL4), each grown three times, two sub-libraries in each of six repeats per condition; the counts of each condition are a MaveDB score set of their own.",
